# A value where a box is wanted: e_nclose (D166).
== SOURCE
n := 1 2; (e_nclose n) c_at n
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Box Int, found Int
 --> -e:1:12
  |
1 | n := 1 2; (e_nclose n) c_at n
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |      --- `n` gets its type here
  |            ---------- this is a Box Int
  |                             - `n` is an Int
  = note: `c_at` has type a -> a -> a
  = help: `e_nclose x` puts a value in a box
